sequenceDiagram
  actor Patient
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as MySQL

  Note over Patient,DB: Select an open slot
  Patient->>FE: Choose department, doctor, date
  FE->>API: GET /api/doctors/:id/availability?date=
  API->>DB: SELECT appointments for doctor+date where status not cancelled
  DB-->>API: Booked times
  API-->>FE: Available 30-min slots
  Patient->>FE: Select slot and continue to confirm

  Note over Patient,DB: Happy path — book slot
  Patient->>FE: Confirm booking
  FE->>API: POST /api/appointments JWT patient
  API->>DB: Validate doctor active and department match
  API->>DB: INSERT appointments status pending duration 30
  alt Unique slot free
    DB-->>API: insertId
    API->>DB: SELECT appointment with doctor and department
    DB-->>API: Appointment row
    API-->>FE: 201 appointment
    FE-->>Patient: Success — Appointment confirmed
  else Slot already taken ER_DUP_ENTRY
    DB-->>API: Duplicate key on doctor date time or active_slot_key
    API-->>FE: 409 Slot already taken
    FE-->>Patient: Error — pick another time
  end
